
## Quick Start (Ubuntu 22.04 / Debian 12)## Files
- `server.conf.example` -> copy to `/etc/wireguard/wg0.conf` after replacing keys
- `client.conf.example` -> template for clients

## IP Plan
- Server: 10.8.0.1/24, fd86:ea04:1111::1/64
- Clients: 10.8.0.2-254, fd86:ea04:1111::2-254
- DNS: 10.8.0.1 forwards to 1.1.1.1

## Important Limitations
Self-hosted VPN hides ISP IP behind VPS IP but does NOT guarantee anonymity. Sites can detect datacenter IPs.
